        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-155, Fancy Swirl Nottingham Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA subtle way to add a little whimsy to your cabinets, the CK-155 Nottingham Knob made by RK International is fancy without being too busy. Each delicate swirl design picks up the highlights of each of the 6 available finishes. The Nottingham Cabinet Knob has a 1-1/4\" diameter and a 1-3/32\" projection so it will feel comfortable in your hand. Made out of zinc, it is sure to last a long time. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/nottingham-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-655\"><b>Matching Nottingham Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Nottingham Collection Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
